WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:02.879
Howdy Waimakariri

00:00:02.879 --> 00:00:05.850
It’s time for the Great Recycling Bin Round
Up.

00:00:05.850 --> 00:00:09.840
Over the coming months, we’ll be fitting
council bins with scannable tags.

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:14.140
This will help us round up rogue bins and
know which property they belong to.

00:00:14.140 --> 00:00:20.720
Look out for this flier in your mailbox or
visit waimakariri.govt.nz/roundup

